  "why_useful": "The dataset is valuable due to its high-resolution immune phenotyping capabilities, which enable the characterization of T-cell repertoires in disease states.",
  "requirements_or_setup": "The necessary prerequisites include access to the Stanford Institutional Review Board–approved protocol and the use of CyTOF, scRNA-seq, and single-cell TCR-seq technologies.",
